{
  "name": "rask-ui-editor-engine",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Builds src/Rask.Ui/Resources/ui-editor.js, the lazily loaded engine behind Ui.Editor: npm ci && node build.mjs. Tiptap is pinned to the release Flux's docs name (2.11.7); prosemirror-model to the last one whose serialised HTML is what Flux's live editor answers (no trailing semicolon in a style attribute).",
